# Local app. Run npm run dev; no cloud credential is needed.
LAB_ENVIRONMENT=local
PORT=3000
# Hosted app: set LAB_ENVIRONMENT=staging or live in Railway.
# Inject LD_SDK_KEY through Railway secret storage, never a build input.
# Required hosted mapping: LD_PROJECT_KEY=default, LD_FLAG_KEY=catalog-ranked-search,
# LD_ENVIRONMENT_KEY=test for staging or production for live.
# Local mode is always offline; it cannot select hosted test data or force a variation.
# Railway supplies RAILWAY_DEPLOYMENT_ID. Build metadata is baked into the image.
# Operator ONLY: supply RAILWAY_PROJECT_TOKEN through a secret store.
# Optional operator LAB_CONFIG_JSON replaces config/lab.json; --config takes precedence.
# SOURCE_SHA and BUILD_RUN_ID are build inputs, not runtime identity overrides.
# Local attestation verification: optional GH_TOKEN for GitHub evidence API access.
# GitHub Actions supplies its own GH_TOKEN, GITHUB_* and ACTIONS_ID_TOKEN_* values.
# Never create or copy an OIDC token into local configuration; local apply is refused.
# Operator reads use LD_READ_TOKEN; protected expose/disable alone receive
# LD_MANAGEMENT_TOKEN. Neither management token belongs in the app or image.
